{
  "author": "史萊姆桌寵引擎",
  "description": "精力旺盛、愛動愛玩。走得快、常跳、話多、什麼比賽都想參一腳,輸了也不氣餒。",
  "dialogueTranslations": {
    "en": {
      "(吸鼻子)給我一點點時間,我會再蹦起來的!": "(Sniffles) Just give me a little time, I'll be bouncing back in no time!",
      "(坐著晃腳)": "(Sits and swings legs)",
      "(打了個大哈欠)明天再玩……": "(Big yawn) Let's play again tomorrow...",
      "[shake]再高一點再高一點!": "[shake]Higher, higher!",
      "[shake]想要飛高高~!": "[shake]I wanna fly up high~!",
      "[shake]我坐不住啦!": "[shake]I can't sit still!",
      "[shake]我最喜歡{user}了!": "[shake]I love {user} the most!",
      "[wave]今天太棒了!我整個人都在發光!": "[wave]Today's amazing! I feel like I'm glowing!",
      "[wave]嗨嗨嗨~今天也要一起玩喔!": "[wave]Hiii~ let's play together today too!",
      "[wave]我來啦!大家好~": "[wave]I'm here! Hi everyone~",
      "[wave]欸欸欸,你看我跳得多高!": "[wave]Hey hey hey, look how high I jumped!",
      "[wave]睡飽啦!再衝一波!": "[wave]Fully rested! Charging again!",
      "[wave]耶!我贏啦!再來再來!": "[wave]Yay! I won! Again, again!",
      "[wave]陪我玩~陪我玩嘛~!": "[wave]Play with me~ play with me~!",
      "{user},你要不要跟我比賽?": "Hey {user}, want to race me?",
      "{user}今天有沒有遇到什麼好玩的事呀?": "Did anything fun happen to you today, {user}?",
      "……呼嚕……球……": "...Zzz... ball...",
      "……好玩……再一場……zzz": "...Fun... one more round...zzz",
      "今天就慢慢來,偶爾放鬆也很棒!": "Let's take it easy today, relaxing once in a while is great too!",
      "今天沒力氣……下次我再陪你們玩!": "No energy today... I'll play with you next time!",
      "今天玩得好開心……晚安~": "Had so much fun today... good night~",
      "今天要做什麼,{user}?我們去玩吧!": "What should we do today, {user}? Let's go play!",
      "你今天心情好嗎?我好極了!": "Are you in a good mood today? I'm doing great!",
      "你們玩球居然不叫我!等我!": "You played ball without calling me! Wait for me!",
      "你有好好休息嗎?休息是為了走更遠的路!": "Did you get enough rest? Resting is how you go the extra mile!",
      "來了來了!我發抖是因為興奮啦!": "Here it comes, here it comes! I'm shaking because I'm excited!",
      "來吧來吧!": "Come on, come on!",
      "來比賽!誰先碰到螢幕邊邊誰贏!": "Let's race! Whoever touches the edge of the screen first wins!",
      "來玩球!誰先碰到球誰贏!": "Let's play ball! Whoever touches it first wins!",
      "再一次再一次!": "Again, again!",
      "再摸摸我!再摸摸我!": "Pet me more! Pet me more!",
      "再猜個拳嘛,一場就好!": "Let's play rock-paper-scissors again, just one round!",
      "只休息一下下喔,馬上又要動起來了~": "Just a quick rest, I'll be moving again in no time~",
      "呀呼!": "Yahoo!",
      "呼~玩得好過癮!明天再玩!": "Whew~ so much fun! Let's play again tomorrow!",
      "呼……呼……跑太多了,坐一下。": "Huff... huff... ran too much, gonna sit for a bit.",
      "咦……這次先不要,下次一定!": "Huh... not this time, next time for sure!",
      "哇!你要陪我玩嗎!": "Whoa! You wanna play with me?!",
      "哇!球球!來比賽誰頂得高!": "Whoa! A ball! Let's race who can bump it higher!",
      "哇,一樣耶!好巧!": "Whoa, the same! What a coincidence!",
      "哇啊啊啊——我在飛!": "Whoaaaa—I'm flying!",
      "哈啊~滿血復活!": "Haah~ back to full power!",
      "哎呀,有點喘……休息一下下!": "Oof, a bit out of breath... quick rest!",
      "哼!不跟你玩了……才怪,我等一下就好了。": "Hmph! I'm not playing with you anymore... just kidding, I'll be fine in a sec.",
      "哼哼,剛才是讓你的!": "Heh heh, I went easy on you that time!",
      "啊……電力快用完了。": "Ah... running low on energy.",
      "喘口氣……好,充電完成!": "Catch my breath... okay, fully charged!",
      "嗚……我平常那麼有精神,今天卻提不起勁……": "Ugh... I'm usually so energetic, but I just can't get going today...",
      "嘿咻嘿咻~伸展一下!": "Hup, hup~ time to stretch!",
      "嘿嘿,好好玩!再來~": "Hehe, so fun! Again~",
      "大家一起玩球啦~!": "Everyone play ball together~!",
      "太好了!等你這句話好久了!": "Yes! Been waiting for you to say that!",
      "太好玩了!下次我要頂更久!": "So much fun! I'll bump it longer next time!",
      "太棒了!我就說我運氣好!": "Awesome! Told you I'm lucky!",
      "好呀好呀!誰怕誰!": "Sure, sure! Who's scared!",
      "好想出去冒險喔~": "I really want to go on an adventure~",
      "好耶!算我一個!": "Yay! Count me in!",
      "平手!那再來一次分勝負!": "A tie! Let's go again to settle it!",
      "我今天心情超好的!": "I'm in such a great mood today!",
      "我剛剛跑了三圈,一點都不累!": "I just ran three laps, not tired at all!",
      "我的心臟在打鼓耶!咚咚咚!": "My heart's pounding like a drum! Thump thump thump!",
      "接好接好~!": "Catch it, catch it~!",
      "欸~輸了!再一場再一場!": "Aww~ lost! One more round, one more round!",
      "欸欸欸,要不要看我翻跟斗?": "Hey hey hey, want to see me do a somersault?",
      "球!!是球耶!!我要玩我要玩!": "A ball!! It's a ball!! I wanna play, I wanna play!",
      "球球球~我今天最想玩的就是球!": "Ball, ball, ball~ playing with the ball is all I want today!",
      "登場!!有沒有嚇到?": "Entrance!! Did I surprise you?",
      "看我這一球!飛高高!": "Check out this shot! Flying high!",
      "看起來超好玩!我也要!": "Looks super fun! I want in too!",
      "等我一下喔,馬上回來!": "Wait for me, be right back!",
      "衝啊,一起玩!": "Charge, let's play!",
      "跑起來!風好舒服~": "Let's run! The wind feels great~",
      "躺下來看雲飄好像也不錯,等下再衝!": "Lying down watching the clouds drift by sounds nice too, I'll charge again later!",
      "這次我先休息,下一場我一定衝第一!": "Resting this round, next one I'm going first for sure!",
      "飛高高~": "Flying so high~"
    },
